BSD 2-Clause License

lz4-oxide is a Rust port of the LZ4 library (the `lib/` directory of
https://github.com/lz4/lz4), which is BSD 2-Clause licensed. As a derivative
work it is distributed under the same license, and retains the original
copyright notices below.

Only `lib/` is ported. The GPL-2.0-or-later parts of the upstream repository
(`programs/`, the CLI) are not included in this work — the C CLI is built from
upstream's own sources and merely linked against this library during testing.

